%% Figure 3. Decision Episode lifecycle with fail-closed outcomes
flowchart LR
  A[Open episode] --> B[Bind evidence + policy versions]
  B --> C[Model / human acts]
  C --> D{Mandatory bindings present?}
  D -->|no| F1[Fail-closed: refuse commitment<br/>or mark non-reconstructable]
  D -->|yes| E[Commitment]
  E --> G[Seal Decision ID + versions]
  G --> H[Historical reconstruction]
  H --> I{Required knowledge retained?}
  I -->|no| F2[Unavailable / partial result]
  I -->|yes| J[Complete triad reconstruction]
